flowchart TB
  accTitle: Disjoint writes followed by joining every worker
  accDescr: Stable descriptors and immutable input remain live until all workers join. Each worker writes a separate output range.
  Parent["Parent: stable descriptors and immutable input"] --> W0["Worker 0: output 0 to a"]
  Parent --> W1["Worker 1: output a to b"]
  Parent --> W2["Worker 2: output b to n"]
  W0 --> Join["Join every started worker"]
  W1 --> Join
  W2 --> Join
  Join --> Consume["Check errors, consume output, release storage"]
